---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { faqs as faqData } from '../../data/faqs';

const faq = faqData['service-areas-buena-park'];
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import CTASection from '../../components/CTASection';
import FAQSection from '../../components/FAQSection';
import ServiceForm from '../../components/ServiceForm';
import Reviews from '../../components/Reviews';
import LicenseBadges from '../../components/LicenseBadges.astro';
import BrandsSection from '../../components/BrandsSection.astro';
import VanSection from '../../components/VanSection.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="AC Repair Buena Park CA | HiLo Heating & Air" description="Need same-day AC repair in Buena Park, CA? Get free diagnostics plus honest, fast fixes from HiLo Heating & Air. Call (714) 853-5534 for fast relief now!" faqSchema={faq.faqSchema}>
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-blue-800 py-20 sm:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">AC Repair Buena Park CA</h1>
        <p class="text-white/80 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Summer around the Knott's entertainment corridor gets brutal, especially when Beach Boulevard traffic traps the afternoon heat. We offer same-day visits with honest answers — explore our <a href="/services/air-conditioning-services/" class="text-white underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-white/70">air conditioning services in Buena Park</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <LicenseBadges />

    <VanSection
      title="Our Service Fleet"
      subtitle="Professional HVAC vehicles ready to serve your home"
    />

    <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-lg">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-brand-blue mt-0 mb-4">Buena Park AC Repair That Shows Up When The Heat Spikes</h2>

        <p>Buena Park is a patchwork of 1960s ranch houses off Stanton, townhomes near the parks, and older rentals tucked behind Beach Boulevard. When an August heat wave parks over the 91 freeway, every one of those layouts suffers the same way. Condensers choke on dust, cottonwood fuzz, and freeway grime while trying to cool rooms that were never sealed tight to begin with.</p>
        <p>That is why our <a href="/services/air-conditioning-services/" class="text-brand-blue underline hover:text-brand-red"><strong>ac repair Buena Park CA</strong></a> visits start with airflow, electrical health, and refrigerant charge before anyone mentions replacement. If your living room stays muggy while bedrooms freeze, or the unit rattles whenever tour buses rumble past on La Palma, we chase the actual cause instead of guessing.</p>
        <p>We're a local company, not a franchise. There's no script we're following, no sales quota we're trying to hit. Just a tech who will tell you straight when a $200 contactor buys you three more summers.</p>

        <h2>When Should You Call for AC Repair in Buena Park?</h2>
        <p>Tourist-season dust plus aging ductwork means Buena Park systems usually whisper before they scream. Weak airflow after 3 p.m. is never normal, even when it hits 95 degrees near the amusement parks.</p>
        <p>Here is the part nobody tells you: letting a limping unit grind through one more heat wave often turns a cheap electrical failure into a dead compressor. Catching that first odd noise keeps the bill small.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Warm air puffing from vents during evening cooldown</li>
          <li>Rattling outdoor unit every time it kicks on</li>
          <li>Thermostat reads 76 but bedrooms feel like 85</li>
          <li>Musty odor blowing out on startup near Beach Blvd</li>
          <li>Breaker trips when AC and microwave run together</li>
          <li>Puddle forming around the indoor air handler closet</li>
          <li>System runs all afternoon yet humidity never drops</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Spotted one of those around Commonwealth or Artesia? Shut the system down and call before the next triple-digit afternoon finishes it off for good.</p>

        <h2>What We Handle</h2>
        <p>Our <strong>ac repair in Buena Park</strong> covers full diagnostics, capacitors, contactors, blower motors, refrigerant leaks, clogged drains, thermostats, and compressors on Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Goodman, Rheem, and York equipment, from tired rooftop package units to new mini-splits in remodeled condos.</p>
        <p>We keep common Buena Park failure parts on the truck, so most jobs wrap in a single trip without leaving you sweating through a weekend crowd on Beach Boulevard.</p>

        <h2>What Makes HiLo Different — Honestly</h2>
        <p>Here's something most HVAC companies won't admit: a lot of AC problems are actually pretty simple fixes. A bad capacitor. A refrigerant top-off. A clogged drain line.</p>
        <p>Around the Knott's corridor we constantly meet folks burned by upsell pressure from big shops chasing rental contracts. We do the opposite and show you photos, pressures, and amp readings before suggesting anything at all.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Free diagnostics included with every same-day repair visit</li>
          <li>Photos and live readings shown before you approve work</li>
          <li>Repair-first mindset with zero pushy equipment swaps</li>
          <li>Local techs who actually know Buena Park streets and housing</li>
        </ul>
        <p>If your system is genuinely done, we will say so plainly and price a replacement fairly — but we will never invent an emergency to get there.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-start">
          <div>
            <span class="inline-block bg-brand-blue/10 text-brand-blue text-sm font-semibold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4">Schedule Service</span>
            <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-4">Get a Free Estimate</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">Fill out the form and our team will get back to you within 15 minutes. Same-day service available.</p>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-blue/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue">Same-Day Service Available</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-blue/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue">Free Diagnostics with Repair</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-brand-blue/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18.75a60.07 60.07 0 0115.797 2.101c.727.198 1.453-.342 1.453-1.096V18.75M3.75 4.5v.75A.75.75 0 013 6h-.75m0 0v-.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125H20.25M2.25 6v9m18-10.5v.75c0 .414.336.75.75.75h.75m-1.5-1.5h.375c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v9.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-.375m1.5-1.5H21a.75.75 0 00-.75.75v.75m0 0H3.75m0 0h-.375a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V15m1.5 1.5v-.75A.75.75 0 003 15h-.75M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm3 0h.008v.008H18V10.5zm-12 0h.008v.008H6V10.5z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue">Upfront Pricing, No Hidden Fees</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ServiceForm client:load />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Reviews client:visible />
    <BrandsSection />

    <FAQSection client:visible faqs={faq.faqs} />

    <section class="bg-brand-blue/5 py-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
        <p class="text-brand-blue font-semibold">HiLo Heating & Air Conditioning · 8131 Electric Ave, Stanton, CA 90680, United States</p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mt-1"><a href="tel:+17148535534" class="hover:text-brand-red transition">(714) 853-5534</a> · <a href="mailto:info@hiloheatingandair.com" class="hover:text-brand-red transition">info@hiloheatingandair.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>


    {/* Internal Linking: Services + Nearby Areas */}
    <section class="py-12 sm:py-16 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-200">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-blue mb-6 text-center">Related HVAC Services in Buena Park</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
          <a href="/services/air-conditioning-services/" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center hover:shadow-md hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition group"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red">Air Conditioning</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">AC repair & install</span></a>
          <a href="/services/heating-services/" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center hover:shadow-md hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition group"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red">Heating Services</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Furnace repair & install</span></a>
          <a href="/services/hvac-services/" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center hover:shadow-md hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition group"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red">HVAC Services</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Maintenance & install</span></a>
          <a href="/services/hvac-services/emergency-hvac-repair/" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center hover:shadow-md hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition group"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red">Emergency Repair</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">24/7 same-day</span></a>
          <a href="/services/air-conditioning-services/ac-maintenance/" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center hover:shadow-md hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition group"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red">AC Maintenance</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Tune-ups</span></a>
          <a href="/services/indoor-air-quality-solutions/" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center hover:shadow-md hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition group"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red">Indoor Air Quality</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Duct & air</span></a>
          <a href="/services/commercial-hvac-services/" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center hover:shadow-md hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition group"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red">Commercial HVAC</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Business systems</span></a>
          <a href="/blogs/" class="bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center hover:shadow-md hover:border-brand-blue/30 transition group"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-brand-blue group-hover:text-brand-red">HVAC Blog</span><span class="block text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Tips & guides</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">Nearby service areas:</p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
            <a href="/service-areas/anaheim/" class="text-sm text-brand-blue hover:text-brand-red hover:underline">Anaheim</a><span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
            <a href="/service-areas/fullerton/" class="text-sm text-brand-blue hover:text-brand-red hover:underline">Fullerton</a><span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
            <a href="/service-areas/cypress/" class="text-sm text-brand-blue hover:text-brand-red hover:underline">Cypress</a><span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
            <a href="/service-areas/garden-grove/" class="text-sm text-brand-blue hover:text-brand-red hover:underline">Garden Grove</a><span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
            <a href="/service-areas/la-habra/" class="text-sm text-brand-blue hover:text-brand-red hover:underline">La Habra</a><span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
            <a href="/service-areas/orange/" class="text-sm text-brand-blue hover:text-brand-red hover:underline">Orange</a><span class="text-slate-300">·</span>
            <a href="/service-areas/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-blue hover:text-brand-red hover:underline">View All Areas →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <CTASection client:visible />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
